  Mode: 85
  IsMultiplayer: 1
  DisplayName: Jackstraw
  Description: 'Threshers only - a brawl in a heap of pick-up sticks floating in every direction. Each
    stick is about a chain long, so your swinging ball is always about to clip one, and
    every stick it breaks costs it speed. Run your ball or chain through a rival pilot to
    strike them - each strike is one point and silences them while they refuel. Crystals
    float in the clearings, out of the sticks'' cover. Higher intensities grow the heap,
    cross the sticks into jacks and add red-tipped sticks. First team to the target wins.'
